{"4829130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Caravanier", "steam_appid": 4829130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/extras/14e8beddd68e0efd6d854cfd6bb8d9f4.avif?t=1787108009\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Caravanier</strong> is an immersive post-apocalyptic merchant RPG set within the decaying hull of the ruined starliner, the Columbia. As a caravanier, your survival depends entirely on your wits, your ledger, and your ability to navigate a shifting world of rival factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/extras/a5ae685acd32cd743caf74e58d461dd3.poster.avif?t=1787108009\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/extras/a5ae685acd32cd743caf74e58d461dd3.webm?t=1787108009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/extras/a5ae685acd32cd743caf74e58d461dd3.mp4?t=1787108009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Master a Dynamic Economy:</strong> Barter physical goods or exchange local currencies across shifting markets. Buy low in desperate outposts and sell high in thriving trade hubs. But be careful, as making too many bad offers might get you kicked out of town</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/extras/464fde2bb51d44a100d7e679e41c85fe.avif?t=1787108009\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight the Encroaching Darkness:</strong> The Columbia's wreckage is consumed by darkness, riddled with bandits, and home to twisted abominations. As your caravan travels, your crew's morale slowly drains. Keep them fed and rested, or watch your low morale chip away at your crew's sanity, making the darkness seemingly come alive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/extras/48c2c7ed8d15670fb25508f2f46417c5.avif?t=1787108009\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Shape the Fate of the Columbia:</strong> Take on special orders that branch the narrative. Your choices can earn you crucial caravan upgrades, stronger town alliances, and seasoned guards to protect your cargo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/extras/de65038cf0f98e76372f074469b3e1bd.avif?t=1787108009\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Navigate a Divided World:</strong> Humanity has fractured. Balance your relationships between the two major powers: Amerikaners, the keepers of the old flame of liberty, and the Catolicos, the old church reborn in this fallen world. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/extras/14e8beddd68e0efd6d854cfd6bb8d9f4.avif?t=1787108009\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Caravanier</strong> is an immersive post-apocalyptic merchant RPG set within the decaying hull of the ruined starliner, the Columbia. As a caravanier, your survival depends entirely on your wits, your ledger, and your ability to navigate a shifting world of rival factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/extras/a5ae685acd32cd743caf74e58d461dd3.poster.avif?t=1787108009\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/extras/a5ae685acd32cd743caf74e58d461dd3.webm?t=1787108009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/extras/a5ae685acd32cd743caf74e58d461dd3.mp4?t=1787108009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Master a Dynamic Economy:</strong> Barter physical goods or exchange local currencies across shifting markets. Buy low in desperate outposts and sell high in thriving trade hubs. But be careful, as making too many bad offers might get you kicked out of town</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/extras/464fde2bb51d44a100d7e679e41c85fe.avif?t=1787108009\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight the Encroaching Darkness:</strong> The Columbia's wreckage is consumed by darkness, riddled with bandits, and home to twisted abominations. As your caravan travels, your crew's morale slowly drains. Keep them fed and rested, or watch your low morale chip away at your crew's sanity, making the darkness seemingly come alive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/extras/48c2c7ed8d15670fb25508f2f46417c5.avif?t=1787108009\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Shape the Fate of the Columbia:</strong> Take on special orders that branch the narrative. Your choices can earn you crucial caravan upgrades, stronger town alliances, and seasoned guards to protect your cargo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/extras/de65038cf0f98e76372f074469b3e1bd.avif?t=1787108009\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Navigate a Divided World:</strong> Humanity has fractured. Balance your relationships between the two major powers: Amerikaners, the keepers of the old flame of liberty, and the Catolicos, the old church reborn in this fallen world. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Lead a post-apocalyptic caravan through the dark wreckage of a fallen colony ship. Caravanier is a 2D top-down trade-based RPG where you exploit lucrative trade routes, barter with rival survivor factions, stave off the encroaching darkness, and shape the fate of this divided world.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/3a32637645669c4f17736bb76f3c0151cbba0d9b/header.jpg?t=1787108009", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/719e0fe448c5763de72717c39d8098b45a98e60a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787108009", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829130/719e0fe448c5763de72717c39d8098b45a98e60a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787108009", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD Athlon II X2 (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stro